[{"client_msg_id":"3aff3c65-645f-4746-a080-f1f9a3a2dade","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"今日かいたやつで分割代入つかってた\n```function capitalize(str: string): string {\n  const [first, ...rest] = [...str.toLowerCase()];\n  return [first.toUpperCase(), ...rest].join(\"\");\n}```","ts":"1632230113.309200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ykk7U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f6eec13-0b1a-4b5f-be32-a45bfc28bc37","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"StateとかPropsとか分割代入があると便利な場面は多いですね","ts":"1632229643.308600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dxaon"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66d9e1bf-b184-4236-bc55-1c8efa8ba89f","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"React書いてると割と分割代入使う気がする","ts":"1632229060.307900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01UVCK03CL","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HbWA6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65110fad-ebd7-412e-8d7e-1ef48b7b4d13","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Vim script を書くときは常にドキドキしているので相対的にあんまドキドキしないですね","ts":"1632216632.305900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"vim_gantan","count":3,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U01TQP86UM6","U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"warau","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS","UA1GWETAA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WhD4/"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *getline()*\ngetline({lnum} [, {end}])\n                {end}が指定されない場合は、カレントバッファの{lnum}行目の内容\n                を文字列にして返す。例:  \n                        getline(1)\n                {lnum}が数字ではない文字で始まる文字列であった場合、|line()|に\n                よってその文字列が数字に変換される。よって、カーソルのある行の\n                文字列を取得するには:  \n                        getline(\".\")\n                {lnum}が1より小さいかバッファの行数よりも大きい数値の場合、空\n                文字列が返される。\n \n                {end}が指定された場合は、カレントバッファの{lnum}行目から\n                {end}行目までを要素とするリスト|List|を返す。\n                {end}は{lnum}と同様に解釈される。\n                存在しない行は省略され、エラーメッセージは表示されない。\n                {end}が{lnum}より前になる場合は空リストを返す。\n                例:  \n                        :let start = line('.')\n                        :let end = search(\"^$\") - 1\n                        :let lines = getline(start, end)\n \n                |method| としても使用できる:  \n                        ComputeLnum()-\u0026gt;getline()\n \n                他のバッファの行を取得するには|getbufline()|を参照。\n```","ts":"1632216517.305400","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"73f8c9f2-902f-4337-863f-7c71c23ca99e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h getline()","ts":"1632216516.305300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sgs1f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4fbf28d-987e-416e-832c-54bedafbc295","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vim scriptの話してます？","ts":"1632216510.305000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qVb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e38aaa82-41f0-4de4-84ba-0e7ee816a6dd","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Python とかだと関数のフラグに応じて返り値のタプルの要素数が変化する、みたいな実装を見かけることがたまにありますね。そういうときに下手に分割代入すると実行時エラーになる場合があります\n静的型付け言語を書いているうちに、そういう（動的に型が変わる）実装を見るとドキドキする体になってしまった","ts":"1632216389.303300","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1632216476.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W+X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6c28110-f3ce-43ed-8982-ffa418f19090","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"分割代入レベルなら使い方ほぼそれなんじゃないかな","ts":"1632216279.301200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"flGQz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb9871ae-0613-4f20-96a6-9af71461c987","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"疑似多値はわかる","ts":"1632216243.300300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3ZNXE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6B68ABC2-2784-4033-B681-A8FD607490F1","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"しかしタプルがあると汎用性があるぶん難解なコードも生みやすくなるな。ビルトインの多値代入しかないgoの判断は良いな","ts":"1632216219.300000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U+G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16E910E4-C03F-4728-9A27-978F0DFAF2CE","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"多値返り値として使うケースは多いのではと","ts":"1632216135.298500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dq5u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c6bcd71-3b07-40d0-8dfd-c5ac47f7a7ef","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```const counterState = useState(0)\nconst counter = counterState[0]\nconst setCounter = counterState[1]```\nもしかしてuseStateとかでもこんな書き方してるとかです？","ts":"1632215824.297900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"khLM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94607c30-f276-4ada-8f18-e5d4f58687ba","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"分割代入使うケースにまだ出会ったことないな","ts":"1632215702.295600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZYU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55A514CC-8F68-410E-9D50-DD9BE7680C4D","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"パターンマッチでスクレイピング思ったより読めなかった","ts":"1632215542.295100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F3Mc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1a0bbd8-058f-4b31-8f48-cd709ebea9dc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"パターンの書き間違いに対する話かな","ts":"1632215368.294600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"de